#: Game/Levels/Properties/L02_ALemmaWorthFactoringOut.lean:10
msgid "Reversing a list does not change its sum. Obvious, and not provable by simply unfolding\n"
"anything — §0 recurses from the front, and §1 puts the front at the back.\n"
"\n"
"What makes it work is the theorem you just proved. §2 says\n"
"\n"
"§3\n"
"\n"
"so the induction step turns the goal into a statement about a concatenation, and\n"
"§4 is exactly the tool for those.\n"
"\n"
"This is the first time in the game that a previous result is load-bearing rather than\n"
"decorative. It will not be the last: the rest of this world, and all of World 4, is built this\n"
