#. §0: `total «{xs}» + total [«{x}»] = «{x}» + total «{xs}»`
#. §1: `total`
#. §2: `simp [total]`
#. §3: `omega`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L02_ALemmaWorthFactoringOut.lean:50
msgid "What is left is §0. Unfold §1 on the\n"
"singleton with §2 and finish with §3."
msgstr "剩下的是 §0。用 §2 把单元素列表上的 §1 展开，\n"
"再用 §3 收尾。"

#. §0: `total_append`
