#: Game/Levels/Properties/L02_ALemmaWorthFactoringOut.lean:55
msgid "Two levels, two theorems, and the second needed the first.\n"
"\n"
"That is worth pausing on, because it is the only way large proofs are ever built. §0\n"
"is not interesting in itself — nobody wants to know it. It is interesting because it is the\n"
"right *shape*: it says what happens to §1 when a list is built by §2, and anything that\n"
"builds lists with §3 can now be reasoned about.\n"
"\n"
"Choosing lemmas by shape rather than by interest is the skill. A good one is stated in terms\n"
"of the operations your proofs actually produce."
msgstr "两关，两个定理，而第二个用上了第一个。\n"
"\n"
"这值得停一下，因为大的证明从来只能这样搭起来。§0 本身并不有趣——\n"
"没人想知道它。它有趣是因为它的*形状*对：它说的是当一个列表由 §2 搭起来时\n"
"§1 会怎样，于是任何用 §3 搭列表的东西现在都能推理了。\n"
"\n"
"按形状而不是按趣味来挑引理，这是手艺所在。好的引理是用你的证明真正产生的那些运算\n"
"来陈述的。"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L03_SafetyTheHardWay.lean:8
msgid "Safety, the Hard Way"
msgstr "笨办法做安全性"

#. §0: `Cslib.LTS`
#. §1: ```
#. def account : LTS Int Op where
#.   Tr := fun s op s' => match op with
#.     | .deposit n => s' = s + n
#.     | .withdraw n => (n : Int) ≤ s ∧ s' = s - n
#. ```
#. §2: `account.MTr s₀ ops s`
#. §3: `s₀`
#. §4: `s`
#. §5: `ops`
#. §6: `refl`
#. §7: `stepL`
#. §8: `refl`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L03_SafetyTheHardWay.lean:10
msgid "Back to state. Here is the question every safety argument has to answer: *the account never\n"
"goes overdrawn, no matter which sequence of operations a customer performs.* There are\n"
"infinitely many such sequences, so you cannot check them.\n"
"\n"
"The account is modelled as a §0 — a labelled transition system. Unlike World 1's\n"
"automaton, a transition here is a **relation** rather than a function, because a withdrawal is\n"
"only a legal step when the balance covers it:\n"
"\n"
"§1\n"
"\n"
"§2 says there is a finite execution from §3 to §4 performing exactly\n"
"the operations §5. It is an inductive relation with two constructors: §6, an execution\n"
"of no steps, and §7, one transition followed by an execution. (§8 is also the name of\n"
"a general reflexivity lemma in Mathlib; writing it as a case name here means the constructor,\n"
"and the inventory unlocks both.)\n"
"\n"
"Prove the safety property by inducting directly on that execution. This is the honest,\n"
"from-first-principles version, and it is the same argument you made for the traffic light in\n"
"World 1 — strengthened statement and all. The next level does it again with a library theorem,\n"
"and the contrast is the point."
msgstr "回到状态上来。这是每个安全性论证都必须回答的问题：*不论客户执行哪一串操作，\n"
"账户都不会透支。*这样的操作串有无穷多条，所以你检查不完。\n"
"\n"
"账户建模为一个 §0——带标号转移系统。与第一世界的自动机不同，这里的转移是一个\n"
"**关系**而不是函数，因为取款只有在余额够的时候才是一个合法的步骤：\n"
"\n"
"§1\n"
"\n"
"§2 说存在一段从 §3 到 §4 的有限执行，所执行的操作恰好是 §5。\n"
"它是一个归纳定义的关系，有两个构造子：§6，零步的执行；以及 §7，一个转移\n"
"接上一段执行。（§8 同时也是 Mathlib 里一个一般自反性引理的名字；在这里把它写成情形名\n"
"指的是那个构造子，而物品栏把两者都解锁了。）\n"
"\n"
"直接对那段执行做归纳来证明这条安全性性质。这是诚实的、从第一性原理出发的版本，\n"
"也正是你在第一世界对交通灯做过的那个论证——连加强陈述这一步都一样。下一关会用一条\n"
"库里的定理再做一次，而对比正是要点。"

#. §0: `account_safe_by_hand : 0 ≤ s₀ → account.MTr s₀ ops s → 0 ≤ s`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L03_SafetyTheHardWay.lean:39
msgid "§0\n"
"\n"
"The account stays in credit — proved by induction over the execution, with no library help."
msgstr "§0\n"
"\n"
"账户始终不透支——对执行做归纳证明，没有借助库。"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L03_SafetyTheHardWay.lean:46
msgid "Prove directly, by induction on the execution, that an account starting in credit never\n"
"becomes overdrawn."
msgstr "直接对执行做归纳，证明一个从有存款开始的账户永远不会透支。"

#. §0: `induction h with`
#. §1: `«{h₀}»`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L03_SafetyTheHardWay.lean:50
msgid "Induct on the execution itself: §0. Lean will carry §1 along,\n"
"re-stating it about whichever state the current case begins in."
msgstr "对执行本身做归纳：§0。Lean 会把 §1 一路带着，\n"
"并把它重新陈述成关于当前情形所起始的那个状态。"

#. §0: `«{h₀}»`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L03_SafetyTheHardWay.lean:54
msgid "No steps were taken, so the final balance is the initial one, and that is §0."
msgstr "一步也没走，所以最终余额就是最初的余额，而那正是 §0。"

#. §0: `«{s1}»`
#. §1: `«{s2}»`
#. §2: `«{s2}»`
#. §3: `«{ih}»`
#. §4: `0 ≤ «{s2}»`
#. §5: `apply ih`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L03_SafetyTheHardWay.lean:57
msgid "One transition from §0 to §1, then an execution from §2. The induction\n"
"hypothesis §3 handles the rest, provided you can show §4. §5 leaves\n"
