#. §2: `ℕ`
#. §3: `ℤ`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L05_ADifferentSystemEntirely.lean:10
msgid "The claim was that §0 is general. Here is the test of it.\n"
"\n"
"A room with a capacity of ten, as a transition system over its occupancy:\n"
