msgstr "证明不论发生怎样的进出序列，这个房间都不会容纳超过十个人。"

#. §0: `have hstep : room.TrInv (fun k => k ≤ 10) := by ...`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L05_ADifferentSystemEntirely.lean:42
