msgstr "同一个定理、一个它从未为之而写的系统，以及零次新的归纳。\n"
"\n"
"这是游戏里两处「库值回票价」演示中的第一处。省下的不是你没敲的那几行。\n"
"省下的是：§0 是对任意 §1 和任意谓词陈述的，所以你建模的下一个系统——\n"
"再下一个也一样——都能用同样的两步拿到它的安全性证明，永远如此。\n"
"\n"
"拿它和第三关比一比：在那里归纳是你自己做的，而在这里还得再写一遍。\n"
"同样的结果，有意思的部分同样难，而差别会不断累积。"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:8
msgid "Strong Enough to Be Inductive"
msgstr "强到足以成为归纳式"

#. §0: ```
#. def tokens : LTS (ℕ × ℕ) Move where
#.   Tr := fun p m q => match m with
#.     | .toA => 0 < p.2 ∧ q = (p.1 + 1, p.2 - 1)
#.     | .toB => 0 < p.1 ∧ q = (p.1 - 1, p.2 + 1)
#. ```
#. §1: `fun p => p.1 ≤ 5`
#. §2: `(5, 3)`
#. §3: `toA`
#. §4: `(6, 2)`
#. §5: `(5, 3)`
#. §6: ```
#. fun p => p.1 + p.2 = 5
#. ```
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:10
msgid "Two buckets hold five tokens between them. A move takes one token from one bucket and puts it\n"
"in the other:\n"
"\n"
"§0\n"
"\n"
"You want: *the first bucket never holds more than five.*\n"
"\n"
"Try to prove that the way you proved the last two, with the property §1, and\n"
"it fails — and the failure is instructive rather than technical. From the state §2 the\n"
"property holds, a §3 move is legal because the second bucket is non-empty, and it leads to\n"
"§4 where the property is false. One step destroys it. The property is **not inductive**.\n"
"\n"
"Of course §5 is not a state the system can actually be in: there are only five tokens.\n"
"But the single-step obligation does not know that. It asks about *every* state satisfying the\n"
"property, including the unreachable ones.\n"
"\n"
"The repair is to prove something stronger — the thing that is actually true of every reachable\n"
"state, namely that the total is conserved:\n"
"\n"
"§6\n"
"\n"
"*That* survives a move, and it implies what you wanted. Finding such a strengthening is the\n"
"central difficulty of invariant-based verification, and there is no recipe; the honest advice\n"
"is that your invariant must explain why the bad states cannot arise, not merely assert they do\n"
"not."
msgstr "两个桶一共装着五枚令牌。一次移动把一枚令牌从一个桶取出放进另一个桶：\n"
"\n"
"§0\n"
"\n"
"你想要的是：*第一个桶里从不超过五枚。*\n"
"\n"
"照你证明前两关的办法，用性质 §1 去试，它会失败——\n"
"而这个失败是有教益的，不是技术性的麻烦。从状态 §2 出发，该性质成立，\n"
"一次 §3 移动是合法的，因为第二个桶非空，而它通向 §4，在那里该性质为假。\n"
"一步就把它破坏了。这个性质**不是归纳式的**。\n"
"\n"
"当然 §5 并不是这个系统真能处于的状态：一共只有五枚令牌。但单步义务不知道这件事。\n"
"它问的是*每个*满足该性质的状态，包括那些不可达的。\n"
"\n"
"修补办法是证明更强的东西——那个对每个可达状态都确实成立的东西，也就是总量守恒：\n"
"\n"
"§6\n"
"\n"
"*那个*能挺过一次移动，而且它蕴涵你想要的东西。找到这样的加强是基于不变式的验证的\n"
"核心难点，而且没有配方；诚实的建议是：你的不变式必须解释为什么坏状态不会出现，\n"
"而不只是断言它们没出现。"

#. §0: `tokens_bounded : p.1 + p.2 = 5 → tokens.MTr p ms q → q.1 ≤ 5`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:46
msgid "§0\n"
"\n"
"The first bucket never holds more than five tokens — proved via the stronger, inductive\n"
"property that the total is conserved."
msgstr "§0\n"
"\n"
"第一个桶里从不超过五枚令牌——通过「总量守恒」这个更强的、归纳式的性质证明。"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:54
msgid "Show that the first bucket never exceeds five tokens, by strengthening the property to\n"
"the conservation of the total."
msgstr "把性质加强为总量守恒，以此证明第一个桶里从不超过五枚令牌。"

#. §0: `have hstep : tokens.TrInv (fun r => r.1 + r.2 = 5) := by ...`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:58
msgid "State the *strengthened* invariant, not the one you want:\n"
"§0"
msgstr "陈述*加强后的*不变式，而不是你想要的那个：\n"
"§0"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:61
msgid "Introduce everything, then split on the move."
msgstr "把一切都引入进来，然后对移动做分情形。"

#. §0: `toA`
#. §1: `simp [tokens] at htr`
#. §2: `obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := htr`
#. §3: `subst h2`
#. §4: `«{r'}»`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:64
msgid "A §0 move. §1 gives you that the second bucket was\n"
"non-empty and what the new pair is; §2 names both, and §3\n"
"replaces §4 by it."
msgstr "一次 §0 移动。§1 告诉你第二个桶当时非空，以及新的序对是什么；\n"
"§2 把两者都命名，而 §3 把 §4 换成它。"

#. §0: `«{r}»`
#. §1: `simp`
#. §2: `omega`
#. §3: `«{h1}»`
#. §4: `ℕ`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:70
msgid "Now the goal is arithmetic about the components of §0. §1 exposes them and\n"
"§2 finishes — but note that you need §3, because subtraction on §4 truncates\n"
"and the equation is only true when the bucket really was non-empty."
msgstr "现在目标是关于 §0 各分量的算术。§1 把它们暴露出来，\n"
"§2 收尾——但注意你需要 §3，因为 §4 上的减法是截断的，\n"
"而那个等式只有在桶确实非空时才成立。"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:75
msgid "The mirror image."
msgstr "镜像的一半。"

#. §0: `have hq := Cslib.LTS.mtrInv_of_trInv hstep p ms q h h₀`
#. §1: `omega`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:81
msgid "Inherit the strengthened property over the whole execution, then weaken it to what\n"
"you were asked for: §0, and §1."
msgstr "把加强后的性质沿整段执行继承下来，再把它弱化成你被要求的那个：\n"
"§0，然后 §1。"

#. §0: `p.1 ≤ 5`
#. §1: `p.1 + p.2 = 5`
#. §2: `ℕ`
#. §3: `p.2 - 1`
#. §4: `p.2 = 0`
#. §5: `0`
#. §6: `-1`
#. §7: `0 < p.2`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L06_StrongEnoughToBeInductive.lean:86
msgid "The bound you wanted, by way of a statement you did not ask for.\n"
"\n"
"This is the standard shape of a real invariant proof, and it is worth naming the two\n"
"directions that can go wrong. An invariant too weak is not preserved by a step, and the\n"
"single-step obligation simply fails — that is what happened to §0. An invariant too\n"
"strong is preserved but false at the start, and the initial obligation fails instead. You are\n"
"looking for something in between, and §1 is it: true initially because that is\n"
"how the tokens were distributed, preserved because moving a token conserves the total, and\n"
"strong enough to give you the bound.\n"
"\n"
"Notice also that truncated subtraction on §2 is quietly doing work here. §3 when\n"
"§4 is §5, not §6, so without the guard §7 the total would not be conserved.\n"
"The transition relation carries that guard, and your proof used it."
msgstr "你想要的那个上界，经由一个你没要求的陈述得到。\n"
"\n"
"这是真实的不变式证明的标准形状，而两个可能出错的方向值得点名。不变式太弱，\n"
"它就挺不过一步，单步义务直接失败——§0 碰到的就是这个。不变式太强，\n"
"它挺得过去但在起点就不成立，于是失败的变成了初始那一项。你要找的是两者之间的东西，\n"
"而 §1 就是：起初为真，因为令牌本来就是那样分的；被保持，因为移动一枚令牌保持总量；\n"
"而且强到足以给你那个上界。\n"
"\n"
"另外请注意，§2 上的截断减法在这里悄悄干了活。§4 为 §5 时 §3 是 §6，\n"
"所以没有 §7 这道守卫，总量就不会守恒。转移关系带着这道守卫，而你的证明用上了它。"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L07_WhereTheNewElementGoes.lean:8
msgid "Where the New Element Goes"
msgstr "新元素去了哪里"

#. §0: ```
#. def ins (a : ℕ) : List ℕ → List ℕ
#.   | [] => [a]
#.   | x :: xs => if a ≤ x then a :: x :: xs else x :: ins a xs
#. ```
#. §1: `ins a xs`
#. §2: `by_cases hax : a ≤ x`
#. §3: `if`
#: Game/Levels/Properties/L07_WhereTheNewElementGoes.lean:10
msgid "Invariants are not only for state machines. A **data-structure invariant** is a property every\n"
"operation on a structure is supposed to preserve, and the argument has the same shape: check\n"
"each operation, inherit the rest.\n"
"\n"
"The structure is a sorted list, and the operation is insertion:\n"
"\n"
"§0\n"
"\n"
"Before proving that insertion preserves sortedness — the next level — prove the smaller fact\n"
"the argument will need: insertion adds the new element and nothing else.\n"
"\n"
"That is a lemma of the kind you met in Level 2, chosen for its shape. The sortedness proof\n"
"will reach a point where it has an element of §1 in hand and needs to know where it\n"
"came from, and this is the theorem that answers.\n"
"\n"
"The proof is induction, with a case split on the comparison. §2 names the\n"
"comparison explicitly, which is what you want, because the two branches of the §3 are the two\n"
"cases of the proof."
msgstr "不变式不只属于状态机。**数据结构不变式**是结构上的每个操作都应当保持的性质，\n"
"而论证的形状是一样的：检查每个操作，其余的继承下来。\n"
"\n"
"结构是一个排好序的列表，操作是插入：\n"
"\n"
"§0\n"
"\n"
"在证明插入保持排好序——也就是下一关——之前，先证明论证将会需要的那个更小的事实：\n"
"插入只添上新元素，别的什么也没添。\n"
"\n"
"这是你在第二关见过的那一类引理，是按形状挑出来的。排好序的证明会走到这样一步：\n"
"手里有 §1 的一个元素，而需要知道它是从哪儿来的，正是这个定理给出答案。\n"
"\n"
"证明是归纳，外加对那个比较做分情形。§2 把这个比较显式地命名，这正是你想要的，\n"
"因为 §3 的两个分支就是证明的两种情形。"

#. §0: `ins_mem : y ∈ ins a xs ↔ y = a ∨ y ∈ xs`
