msgstr "§0 留在最前面，而 §1 被插进尾部，所以归纳假设 §2 描述的是尾部。\n"
"§3 把你带到一个纯粹是命题重排的目标，由 §4 收尾。"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L07_WhereTheNewElementGoes.lean:64
msgid "Insertion adds one element and loses none.\n"
"\n"
"On its own this says nothing about order, which is deliberate: it is the part of the story\n"
"that the *sortedness* argument will need as an ingredient, and keeping the two apart is what\n"
"lets each be proved cleanly. Separating a structural fact from an ordering fact, proving each\n"
"once, and combining them, is how the whole of World 4 is going to be organised."
msgstr "插入添上一个元素，一个也没丢。\n"
"\n"
"它本身对顺序只字未提，这是有意的：它是故事里*排好序*那段论证需要当作配料的部分，\n"
"而把两者分开，正是让每一个都能干净地证明出来的原因。把一个结构性事实与一个顺序性事实\n"
"分开、各证一次、再合起来，正是整个第四世界的组织方式。"

#: Game/Levels/Properties/L08_SortednessSurvivesAnInsertion.lean:8
