#: Game/Levels/Verification/L10_DiscardingTheCost.lean:11
msgid "Here is the obstacle. §0 is §1 at §2, and Mathlib's\n"
"theorems about sorting are about §3, which is an entirely different\n"
"definition. Nothing connects them syntactically.\n"
"\n"
"What connects them is an idea. Throwing the cost away and keeping the result is a **monad\n"
