"live.\n"
"\n"
"Prove that bridge. It is the single most useful line in this world, and the next two levels\n"
"both begin with it.\n"
"\n"
"One wrinkle: the homomorphism leaves a §8 wrapper on one side and a §9\n"
"where the goal wants §10. Simplifying the hypothesis **and** the goal together —\n"
"§11 — clears both. Simplifying only the hypothesis does not."
msgstr "障碍在这里。§0 是 §2 处的 §1，而 Mathlib 关于排序的定理是关于 §3 的，\n"
"那是一个完全不同的定义。它们在语法上毫无关联。\n"
"\n"
"把它们联系起来的是一个想法。把开销丢掉、只留下结果，这是一个 **monad 同态**：\n"
"它与 §4 交换，与 §5 交换，与 §6 记号所由构成的一切都交换。CSlib 把两半都陈述了出来：\n"
"\n"
"§7\n"
"\n"
