#: Game/Levels/Verification/L12_ABoundOnTheComparisons.lean:11
msgid "The capstone. Prove that sorting a list of §0 elements never costs more than §1\n"
"comparisons.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing you have done so far helps directly. §2 is about §3, and the whole\n"
"point of the previous level was that it says nothing about §4. There is no theorem in\n"
"either library whose statement is this one. You are going to do an induction, and you need two\n"
"ingredients before you can start.\n"
"\n"
"**One insertion is linear.** §5 compares the new element with the elements\n"
"of the list from the front and stops when it finds its place, so it performs at most as many\n"
"comparisons as the list is long. That is an induction on the list, using\n"
"§6 to expose one step and §7's §8 to see that costs add.\n"
"\n"
"**The sorted list has the same length.** Insertion sort's recursive call produces a list the\n"
"same length as its input, which is what makes the first ingredient useful at each step. You\n"
"could prove that by a second induction, but you do not have to — §9 says the\n"
"result is §10, and §11 says that preserves length.\n"
"A use for the bridge in a proof that is otherwise entirely about cost.\n"
"\n"
"With both in hand, the induction is arithmetic: sorting §12 costs what sorting §13 cost,\n"
"plus at most §14 for the insertion, and §15."
msgstr "压轴。证明排一个有 §0 个元素的列表，花费从不超过 §1 次比较。\n"
"\n"
"你到目前为止做过的一切都帮不上直接的忙。§2 是关于 §3 的，而上一关的全部要点就是\n"
"它关于 §4 什么也没说。两个库里都没有哪条定理的陈述就是这一条。你将要做一次归纳，\n"
"而在开始之前你需要两样配料。\n"
"\n"
"**一次插入是线性的。**§5 从前端起把新元素与列表里的元素逐个比较，找到位置就停下，\n"
"所以它做的比较至多和列表的长度一样多。这是对列表的一次归纳，用 §6 把一步暴露出来，\n"
"再用 §7 的 §8 看出开销会相加。\n"
"\n"
"**排好序的列表长度不变。**插入排序的递归调用产出一个与其输入等长的列表，\n"
"而这正是第一样配料在每一步都好用的原因。你本可以再做一次归纳来证明它，但不必——\n"
"§9 说结果就是 §10，而 §11 说那不改变长度。\n"
"在一个除此之外全是关于开销的证明里，这是那座桥的一处用场。\n"
"\n"
"两样都到手之后，归纳就是算术了：排 §12 的花费等于排 §13 的花费，\n"
"加上插入那部分至多 §14，而 §15。"

