#: Game.lean:53
msgid "Specify, reason about, and verify programs in Lean 4."
msgstr "在 Lean 4 中对程序进行规约、推理与验证。"

#: Game.lean:54
msgid "Learn program verification with CSlib abstractions: explore state-based models,\n"
"write specifications that describe intended behavior, prove invariants that hold across executions,\n"
"and verify a complete sorting implementation. An optional branch covers refinement, simulation and\n"
"bisimulation."
msgstr "借助 CSlib 抽象学习程序验证：探索基于状态的模型，\n"
"写出描述预期行为的规约，证明在所有执行中都成立的不变式，\n"
"并验证一个完整的排序实现。一条可选支线涵盖精化、模拟与双模拟。"
